+
+ Returns:
+    None
+
+ Global Variables Used:
+    None.
+
+ Local Variables Needed:
+    None.
+
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ FUNCTION DESCRIPTION
+
+ This function resets the state data for the ec_gain module.
